    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i don't even exist anymore. like everyone i knew just collectively decided i don't matter. it's like i've been erased from everything. there's no way to fix this, there's no way to ever go back to being a person people actually want around. i'm just a ghost now.",
