    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a \"perception\" though. people actually stopped calling. they left the group chats. even my family acts like i'm a stranger. it's not my mind tricking me, it's the reality of the situation. i'm socially dead. there's no \"finding myself\" when there's no society left to let me back in.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
