    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "what do you mean by a controlled release? it... it just feels like everything is too loud and too much. like there's no point in trying to fight for a seat at a table that doesn't even exist anymore. if the world has already decided i'm gone, why should i keep pretending i'm still here?",
